```

Targets are expressed as positions on each dimension's named scale so they read naturally ("tests team-target 0.75 ≈ 'substantial' on the 5-rung ladder"), and comments record deliberate ceilings ("`governed` needs the P3 review/decay loop, so org targets curated until it ships"). `scoreAgainstRubric` returns `belowTarget` weakest-first — the same rows the remediation planner consumes. Pinned by `goldenStandard.test.ts`.

