```

The timeout branch kills the child and returns `Unauthed` ("Present but hanging — almost always an interactive prompt ... actionable, and it can never wedge the readiness path"). Anyone shelling out to npm-shim CLIs from a Windows desktop app hits every one of these.

Evidence: `src-tauri/src/commands/design/analysis.rs::cancel_design_analysis`:

```rust
